  "title": "HarperCollins to publish Sonia Gandhi's memoir in India, Prince Harry and Meghan Markle returning to UK, and Dolly Parton's passing",
  "summary": "HarperCollins India will publish Sonia Gandhi's memoir on November 10 after Penguin Random House India withdrew from publishing it following a dispute over editorial changes. Prince Harry and Meghan Markle will return to live in the United Kingdom after six years in the U.S., with their children set to start their new lives in September. Dolly Parton passed away at the age of 80, marking a significant milestone in her career.",
